  "releaseNotes": "Calendar-history APIs (GetEnergyCalendarHistoryAsync, GetPowerCalendarHistoryAsync, GetStateOfEnergyCalendarHistoryAsync, GetSelfConsumptionCalendarHistoryAsync, GetBackupCalendarHistoryAsync) now return strongly-typed, Json.NET-mapped model records instead of raw JSON, and accept a new HistoryPeriod enum (Day, Week, Month, Year, Lifetime) in place of a period string. Raw string-based history APIs are unaffected.",
